WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.870
Episode 25: Night of the False Wedding

2
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.368
Soaring high above the imperial
metropolis of Lighthaven,

3
00:00:08.468 --> 00:00:11.840
the Grand Cathedral of White Marble appeared
cloaked in dazzling festive grandeur.

4
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.951
From every vaulted spire fluttered crimson silk tapestries bearing the
imperial crest, while within the nave, thousands of gilded candelabras

5
00:00:15.051 --> 00:00:17.810
cast shimmering radiance across the polished marble flags. Yet beneath
this extravagant facade lay an atmosphere of suffocating dread.

6
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.531
Stationed in every shadowed alcove stood imperial
shock guards and black-robed inquisitors,

7
00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:23.780
eyeing the gathered aristocracy
with predatory vigilance.

8
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:29.750
The ceremony was a grotesque political
farce manufactured by High Minister Lucian.

9
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.755
By coercing a forced union between his puppet cousin
and the captured elven noblewoman, Lady Sylvia,

10
00:00:32.855 --> 00:00:35.720
Lucian intended to legitimize his usurpation of the
eastern seaboard and the Whispering Wind alliance.

11
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.769
Slipping through the throng of commoners outside the
cathedral doors were two figures robed in rustic northern

12
00:00:38.869 --> 00:00:41.690
minstrel tunics. Kadan, his brow concealed beneath a
thick fur cowl, and Cilia, veiled in fine northern silk.

13
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:47.660
Whispering beneath her veil,
Cilia noted with sharp eyes.

14
00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.808
[Celia] "Upon Lady Sylvia's wrists are mana shackles
inscribed with Medusa Gorgo's puppet curse.

15
00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:53.630
They paralyze the spirit, forcing her hands
to sign the blood covenant against her will."

16
00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:59.600
Kadan touched the contours of the Dragon
Breaker shield beneath his mantle.

17
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:02.089
[Kadan] "Ignis has infiltrated the
belfry to sever the alarm ropes.

18
00:01:02.189 --> 00:01:05.570
The instant the ceremony reaches its peak and
Lucian's guard slackens, we strike the high altar."

19
00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:08.633
A thunderous overture from
the great pipe organ filled

20
00:01:08.733 --> 00:01:11.540
the vaulted cathedral as
the false wedding commenced.

21
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.612
Draped in opulent scarlet clerical vestments
and bearing the archiepiscopal staff,

22
00:01:14.712 --> 00:01:17.510
Minister Lucian strode onto the high
pulpit, an arrogant sneer curling his lips.

23
00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:23.480
[Kadan] "Citizens of the empire!

24
00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.677
Today, through this sacred bond,

25
00:01:25.777 --> 00:01:29.450
all embers of northern sedition
are extinguished forever!

26
00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:35.420
Let Lady Sylvia sign the blood covenant
in humble obedience to the throne!"

27
00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.518
[Lucian] Inquisitors seized Sylvia's
hands, forcing a poisoned quill into

28
00:01:38.618 --> 00:01:41.390
her trembling fingers while silent
tears tracked down her pale cheeks.

29
00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:44.550
In that fatal heartbeat, the
massive stained-glass rose window

30
00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.360
high above shattered into a
shower of crystalline shards.

31
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.251
Having disabled the alarms, Ignis
descended upon a severed bell rope,

32
00:01:50.351 --> 00:01:53.330
unleashing a barrage of immaculate white
firebolts directly into the pulpit.

33
00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.512
Boom! The pulpit exploded into kindling,

34
00:01:55.612 --> 00:01:59.300
setting Lucian's vestments ablaze as
screams of panic consumed the nave.

35
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.322
[Ignis] Landing gracefully upon the altar rail, Ignis
unleashed a lion's roar. "Deceive the realm no longer with

36
00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:05.270
your cowardly lies, butcher Lucian! The true fire of the
White Flame Order has arrived to deliver your judgment!"

37
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:11.240
Clutching his smoldering robes,
Lucian shrieked in terror.

38
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:17.210
[Lucian] "Traitorous dogs!

39
00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:23.180
Guards, cut them down!

40
00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:29.150
[Lucian] Drown this
altar in northern blood!"

41
00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.155
As dozens of heavy cataphracts surged toward the
dais with drawn broadswords, Kadan cast aside his

42
00:02:32.255 --> 00:02:35.120
minstrel disguise, striding forward as the golden
cross of the Dragon Breaker shield blazed to life.

43
00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:41.090
Slamming his shield against the marble
steps, Kadan anchored his stance.

44
00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.087
Boom! An earthquake of kinetic force buckled the flagstones,
blasting the charging cataphracts headlong into the air.

45
00:02:44.187 --> 00:02:47.060
Shielding Lady Sylvia behind his immovable frame, Kadan
deflected a barrage of throwing spears into the vaulted ceiling.

46
00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:53.030
[Kadan] "Not a single foot
shall touch this innocent soul!"

47
00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.124
Simultaneously, Cilia swept her Jade
Staff, conjuring razor winds that neatly

48
00:02:56.224 --> 00:02:59.000
severed the puppet shackles binding
Sylvia's wrists with a metallic chime.

49
00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.303
[Sylvia] Tears spilling down her cheeks,

50
00:03:01.403 --> 00:03:04.970
Sylvia looked upon her deliverers
in awe. "Knights of the Light...

51
00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:10.940
[Sylvia] Princess Cilia...

52
00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:13.764
[Kadan] You have come
for me..." The cathedral

53
00:03:13.864 --> 00:03:16.910
erupted into a battleground
of truth against tyranny.

54
00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:20.044
Witnessing the ancient cross of the Holy
Order and Ignis's sanctifying flames,

55
00:03:20.144 --> 00:03:22.880
the gathered citizens and lesser nobles
stirred in turbulent realization.

56
00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:28.850
[Capital Citizens] "That crest... The
Arcane Holy Knights have returned!"

57
00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:31.914
[Capital Citizens] "Commander Ignis fights against
the court's assassins!" Terrified by the rising tide

58
00:03:32.014 --> 00:03:34.820
of public revolt, Lucian fled toward the private
iron sally port behind the altar under heavy escort.

59
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.018
[Lucian] Lucian shrieked over
his shoulder into the gloom.

60
00:03:38.118 --> 00:03:40.790
"Artus! Tear those miserable
vermin limb from limb!"

61
00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.660
From the subterranean crypts beneath
the altar radiated the freezing chill of

62
00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.760
death as a colossal figure clad in cracked
obsidian plate emerged: Death Knight Artus.

63
00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.971
His crimson visor flared
with baleful malice,

64
00:03:50.071 --> 00:03:52.730
brandishing his broken runic greatsword.

65
00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.765
[Kadan] Stepping forward, Kadan braced
the Dragon Breaker shield against the

66
00:03:55.865 --> 00:03:58.700
undead champion. "Abandoned by the tyrant
you serve like a discarded puppet.

67
00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:04.670
But this shield shall never
yield before your defiled blade!"

68
00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:10.640
Artus's obsidian blade crashed against
Kadan's guard with cataclysmic fury.

69
00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:14.184
Yet the reinforced dragonbone armor
absorbed the death magic without flinching,

70
00:04:14.284 --> 00:04:16.610
hurling the death knight
backward with concussive force.

71
00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.467
Ignis unleashed a torrent of holy
fire, scorching Artus's pauldrons and

72
00:04:19.567 --> 00:04:22.580
forcing the fiend to retreat into the
shadows, bolting the iron gate behind him.

73
00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:28.550
Though Lucian had fled into the inner
citadel, the cathedral was liberated.

74
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.261
Weeping in gratitude, citizens and nobles

75
00:04:31.361 --> 00:04:34.520
surrounded the three heroes
with thunderous cheers.

76
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.653
The false wedding was smashed,

77
00:04:36.753 --> 00:04:40.490
and the empire's crimes were
laid bare before the realm.

78
00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:43.386
[Celia] Ascending the altar
steps, Cilia raised her

79
00:04:43.486 --> 00:04:46.460
Jade Staff before the multitude.
"People of the capital!

80
00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:52.430
Kneel no longer before Lucian's
falsehoods and terror!

81
00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:58.400
[Kadan] Rise with us to reclaim true
peace and honor for this continent!"

82
00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.713
A roar of thousands echoed
through the rafters,

83
00:05:01.813 --> 00:05:04.370
shaking the citadel to its foundations.

84
00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:10.340
Kadan clasped Ignis's forearm, their
eyes fixed upon the inner palace gates.

85
00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.390
[Ignis] “Only one door remains.

86
00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:16.310
Let us march into the inner court
and end this darkness forever.”

87
